JECT InstId="42856107" Lock="false" NumberingType="Equation" ZOrder="7786"><SIZE Height="1125" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="587" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="56" Right="56" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>수식입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SCRIPT>c`</SCRIPT></EQUATION><CHAR>를 잘못 보고 푼 경우, </CHAR><EQUATION BaseLine="85" BaseUnit="1100" LineMode="false" TextColor="0" Version="Equation Version 60"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="74025666" Lock="false" NumberingType="Equation" ZOrder="7786"><SIZE Height="1125" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="662" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="56" Right="56" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>수식입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SCRIPT>a`</SCRIPT></EQUATION><CHAR>와 </CHAR><EQUATION BaseLine="85" BaseUnit="1100" LineMode="false" TextColor="0" Version="Equation Version 60"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="44050852" Lock="false" NumberingType="Equation" ZOrder="7786"><SIZE Height="1125" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="587" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="56" Right="56" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>수식입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SCRIPT>b`</SCRIPT></EQUATION><CHAR>는 올바르게 보았으므로 두 근의 합은 정확하다. 근과 계수의 관계에 의해, </CHAR><EQUATION BaseLine="65" BaseUnit="1100" LineMode="false" TextColor="0" Version="Equation Version 60"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="15992987" Lock="false" NumberingType="Equation" ZOrder="7786"><SIZE Height="2580" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="12971" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="56" Right="56" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>수식입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SCRIPT>{- left(-b right)} over {a} ={b} over {a} = 6 +{10} over {3} ={28} over {3}`</SCRIPT></EQUATION><CHAR>이다. 따라서 처음 이차방정식은 </CHAR><EQUATION BaseLine="65" BaseUnit="1100" LineMode="false" TextColor="0" Version="Equation Version 60"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="23399766" Lock="false" NumberingType="Equation" ZOrder="7786"><SIZE Height="2580" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="7825" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="56" Right="56" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>수식입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SCRIPT>x ^{2}-{b} over {a}x +{c} over {a} = 0`</SCRIPT></EQUATION><CHAR>의 형태이므로, </CHAR><EQUATION BaseLine="65" BaseUnit="1100" LineMode="false" TextColor="0" Version="Equation Version 60"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="68305567" Lock="false" NumberingType="Equation" ZOrder="7786"><SIZE Height="2580" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="7981" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="56" Right="56" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>수식입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SCRIPT>x ^{2}-{28} over {3}x + 3 = 0`</SCRIPT></EQUATION><CHAR>이다. 양변에 </CHAR><EQUATION BaseLine="85" Bas