CHAR>명이다. 감독은 내일 경기를 위해 현재 명단에 포함된 선수 중 </CHAR><EQUATION BaseLine="85" BaseUnit="1100" LineMode="false" TextColor="0" Version="Equation Version 60"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="52997800" Lock="false" NumberingType="Equation" ZOrder="7786"><SIZE Height="1125" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="662" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="56" Right="56" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>수식입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SCRIPT>2`</SCRIPT></EQUATION><CHAR>명을 제외하고, 후보 명단에 있는 선수 중 </CHAR><EQUATION BaseLine="85" BaseUnit="1100" LineMode="false" TextColor="0" Version="Equation Version 60"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="11057493" Lock="false" NumberingType="Equation" ZOrder="7786"><SIZE Height="1125" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="662" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="56" Right="56" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>수식입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SCRIPT>2`</SCRIPT></EQUATION><CHAR>명을 새롭게 추가하여 총 인원을 </CHAR><EQUATION BaseLine="85" BaseUnit="1100" LineMode="false" TextColor="0" Version="Equation Version 60"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="23158137" Lock="false" NumberingType="Equation" ZOrder="7786"><SIZE Height="1125" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="1187" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="56" Right="56" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>수식입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SCRIPT>28`</SCRIPT></EQUATION><CHAR>명으로 유지하려고 한다. 다음 조건을 모두 만족하도록 명단을 변경하는 경우의 수를 구하고 그 과정을 서술하시오.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="1" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="0"><TABLE BorderFill="5" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="1" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="1"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="88652287" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="446030"><SIZE Height="22396" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="28776" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="0" Right="0" Top="0"/><CAPTION FullSize="false" Gap="0" LastWidth="0" Side="Left" Width="0"><PARALIST LineWrap="Squeeze" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="1" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="11"><CHAR>V3Wu4c5Rp1ux0iy34V8evXe+dQTk6+ZvsBmyEYN8E2nGxZ7oD4Jjygx8Ld1xvQt0JVTIo7QoV6VFZyCIUS0+Vcxsdssclw==</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CAPTION><SHAPECOMMENT>이동권</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="1133" Left="0" Right="0" Top="1133"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="5" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="282" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="28776"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="7" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="0"><CHAR>(가) 명단에서 제외되는 </CHAR><EQUATION BaseLine="85" BaseUnit="1100" LineMode="false" TextColor="0" Version="Equation Version 60"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="85180151" Lock="false" NumberingType="Equation" ZOrder="7786"><SIZE Height="1125" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="662" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="56" Right="56" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>수식입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SCRIPT>2`</SCRIPT></EQUATION><CHAR>명의 선수는 서로 다른 포지션 소속이어야 하며, 포수는 제외될 수 없다.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="7" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="0"><CHAR>(나) 새롭게 추가되는 </CHAR><EQUATION BaseLine="85" BaseUnit="1100" LineMode="false" TextColor="0" Version="Equation Version 60"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="36463286" Lock="false" NumberingType="Equation" ZOrder="7786"><SIZE Height="1125" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="662" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="56" Right="56" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>수식입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SCRIPT>2`</SCRIPT></EQUATION><CHAR>명은 후보 명단에 있는 투수 </CHAR><EQUATION BaseLine="85" BaseUnit="1100" LineMode="false" TextColor="0" Version="Equation Version 60"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="45932804" Lock="false" NumberingType="Equation" ZOrder="7786"><SIZE Height="1125" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="662" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="0" Left="56" Right="56" Top="0"/><SHAPECOMMENT>수식입니다.</SHAPECOMMENT></SHAPEOBJECT><SCRIPT>3`</SCRIPT></EQUATION><CHAR>명, 내야수 </CHAR><EQUATION BaseLine="85" BaseUnit="1100" LineMode="false" TextColor="0" Version="Equation Version 60"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="74604926" Lock="false" NumberingType="Equation" ZOrder="7786"><SIZE Height="1125" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="662" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="fa